{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671950/extras/demo_about_en.png?t=1747386681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo, discover the fascinating world of Our Journey by playing the beginning of the adventure! (1 chapter out of 4)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a friend, play two different roles: the body and his Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671950/extras/tuto_en.png?t=1747386681\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Discover the characters and how to collaborate without talking !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spirit:</strong> Guide your partner through the world by playing symbols cards.<br><strong>The body:</strong> Determine your destination by comparing the received cards to the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have fun progressing through the world by interpreting your partner\u2019s messages. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671950?t=1747386681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671950?t=1747386681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671950/dcc1fad72a82d7fcfa820b8129446f8e98e143ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747386681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671950/dcc1fad72a82d7fcfa820b8129446f8e98e143ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747386681","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img c